# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone FWS_External / interface External
#   zone FWS_Trusted / interface Trusted
#   zone DMZ / interface DMZ
#   zone FWS_Guests / interface Guests
#   zone FWS_Lab / interface Lab
# Written inactive:
#   DMZ Updates: schedule 'Business Hours' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times; 'Update-Site.1.alm' holds members only its platform knows
#   Staff Only: source user match Staff is not converted
